 378: ## 6. Evidence record and status semantics
 379: 
 380: Create a timestamped evidence directory in the clean account and retain:
 381: 
 382: - host/Lima inventory and clean-state listing;
 383: - workflow URL/run ID, commit/tag, archive hashes, full tar listing, manifest,
 384:   and checksum results;
