 386: - separate xattr output plus exit status for archive, directory, and binary in
 387:   both download paths;
 388: - terminal transcript and any Gatekeeper UI screenshots for first run;
 389: - launcher status/diagnose output, Lima list/config, guest kernel/arch,
 390:   canary, service status, HTTP result, and hello capability response;
 391: - browser/HTTP/WS lab evidence, console transcript, and ping summary;
 392: - before/after upgrade identity hashes and pinned-kernel output;
