+missing, mismatched-basename, or malformed lines fail the job.
 
-Normalize file modes, owner/group metadata, member ordering, and timestamps
-from `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`; create gzip output without an embedded current-time
-header. A packaging test builds twice from identical inputs and requires
-identical archive SHA-256 values. The archive filename stays unversioned as
